inflectg2p

This project contains an independently packaged implementation of the public Inflect v2 phoneme and token-ID frontend contract. The upstream Inflect frontend was released by Owen Song under Apache-2.0.

Third-party dependencies and optional pronunciation assets retain their own licenses and notices. eSpeak/eSpeak NG runtime access is provided through espeakng-runtime. Optional lexicon support may use Lexphon and G2Lex.
